  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Soutien pour l&apos;&#xe9;quipe national d&apos;intervention CBRN du Canada &#xe0; des conf&#xe9;rences internationaux</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Canada&#x2019;s CBRN National Response Team expertise in International Conferences</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ce projet vise &#xe0; financer les frais de d&#xe9;placement des experts de la Gendarmerie royale du Canada (GRC) lorsqu&#x2019;ils participent &#xe0; des activit&#xe9;s li&#xe9;es &#xe0; la conduite d&#x2019;enqu&#xea;tes sur des incidents terroristes chimiques et biologiques.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project reimburses the travel costs associated with the travel of experts from RCMP to participate in activities related to strengthening chemical and biological terrorism investigations. Additionally, activities supported WTRP objectives as they are enhancing international capabilities to prevent biological and chemical weapons proliferation and terrorism through knowledge sharing.</narrative>
  </description>
